mestamp": "01:27:31", "text": "千万不要像推搡树木那样去碰它"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 5251.752, "timestamp": "01:27:31", "author": "@Orange-Sleipnir", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_n5J-87avtPs7B_snpcnK5WQMhN-5kM_m8EJRYz2oJ72Wg=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "don't shake the sakura tree"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5253.11, "timestamp": "01:27:33", "text": "掉落或像折断树枝那样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5254.629, "timestamp": "01:27:34", "text": "因为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5256.07, "timestamp": "01:27:36", "text": "有些地方可能不会写这一点。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5258.79, "timestamp": "01:27:38", "text": "这样做是不允许的，好吧，但它还是发生了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5263.03, "timestamp": "01:27:43", "text": "出于尊重，所以你不应该"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 5264.304, "timestamp": "01:27:44", "author": "@Orange-Sleipnir", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_n5J-87avtPs7B_snpcnK5WQMhN-5kM_m8EJRYz2oJ72Wg=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "heyoo saikat"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5264.87, "timestamp": "01:27:44", "text": "有些地方不写，所以如果"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5266.629, "timestamp": "01:27:46", "text": "那里有些人喜欢那样，如果"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5268.31, "timestamp": "01:27:48", "text": "尤其是一些游客"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5269.91, "timestamp": "01:27:49", "text": "他们会说，哦，没有回头路了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5271.83, "timestamp": "01:27:51", "text": "我们不能碰这里，因为就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5274.39, "timestamp": "01:27:54", "text": "尤其是在像这里这样的地方"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5276.149, "timestamp": "01:27:56", "text": "当你摘下它时，它们什么也不说。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5278.39, "timestamp": "01:27:58", "text": "树上的花之类的东西。是的。但"}]